  "details": "Why on earth did the keyboard get pushed live? There are STILL so many complaints, including my own where the accessibility of the keyboard is REALLY bad and people not like the changes?\n\nWhy is it being rushed out the door when there are SO MANY ISSUES with the new keyboard and input UI? MAINLY being that they are NOT just ONE UI box making communicating for disabled users, such as myself, WAY more tedious or nearly impossible to hold a conversation anymore with how bad the new keyboard is?\n\nThis was such a terrible decision, and I'm unsubscribing with VRC+ until this is fixed or reverted.\n\nI guess screw the disabled users huh?",
